        "title": "Break Bad Habits",
        "description": "Break Bad Habits is an app that helps you track and control bad habits in your life — such as smoking, drinking, staying up late, overspending, or any habit you want to eliminate.\n\nAdd each habit to your list and monitor your progress over time. The app helps you clearly see:\n\n• How long you have maintained\n• How much money you have saved (if any)\n• The next milestone to reach\n• The titles you have achieved\n\nEach habit has its own detailed screen, helping you stay focused on the present and maintain your streak of violation-free days.\n\n📊 Detailed Reports\n\nThe app provides a comprehensive report screen so you can review your entire journey:\n\n• Total time since starting\n• Duration of your current streak\n• Total money spent on bad habits\n• Total money saved\n• Number of resets (stumbles) and reasons\n\n🧠 Simple & Pressure-Free\n\nThe app is designed to support you without pressure:\n\n• No judgment\n• No pressure\n• Just honesty with yourself\n\n🔒 Privacy First\n\nAll data is stored directly on your device:\n\n• No login required\n• No internet connection required\n• No personal data collection\n• Completely free\n\n🌱 A Small Step Every Day\n\nThis is not a medical or psychological treatment app.\nIt is a simple tool to help you observe your behavior and improve step by step.\n\nEvery day you keep going, you are better than yesterday.",
