        "description": "Charging Power gives you complete insight into your device’s charging process.\nTrack charging current, voltage, power, and detailed information about your battery and hardware.\n\n🔋 Key Features:\n- Real-time charging current (mA), voltage (V), and power (W).\n- Monitor battery level, charging status (charging, full, not charging).\n- Display battery temperature, charge cycles, maximum capacity.\n- View hardware details: CPU, clock speed, RAM, storage.\n- GPU info: model, manufacturer, architecture.\n- Clean, user-friendly interface with eye-friendly colors.\n\n📊 Benefits:\n- Check if your charger and cable deliver proper power.\n- Detect slow charging or unstable charging.\n- Extend battery lifespan by monitoring temperature and charge cycles.\n- Useful for both everyday users and power users.\n- This app is lightweight, intuitive, and free from annoying ads — making battery and device monitoring simple and effective.\n\nThis app is lightweight, intuitive, and free from annoying ads — making battery and device monitoring simple and effective.",
